  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, I know you developer's were probably forced into EAC and I understand you don't have time to upload ALL the features that the mods lost us. SOO! Let us do our work give us steam workshop support and let a map creator decide to disable these with a pre programmed option so that you don't have to worry about the worlds you want to not have these extra features. A game creator simply ticks a box somewhere in the sdk and steam workshop features cease to work in their world and some worlds which don't matter like chill out worlds will still have the features for making the game more fun. Its a compromise I think we could all agree would fix many issues.",
